---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Gabriel Alisasis – Operations & Automation Specialist"
  description="Gabriel Alisasis – GoHighLevel automation specialist and operations manager. CRM systems, workflow automation, and the operational systems that let businesses scale."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-blob" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="bento-status reveal">Available for work</div>

      <h1>Systems that run the business, <em>not you.</em></h1>

      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="lede"><strong>GoHighLevel automation specialist and operations manager.</strong> I build the CRM workflows and backend systems that scale without breaking, and when it runs deeper than a workflow builder, I write the code.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary magnetic">Book a call →</a>
            <a href="/work" class="btn btn-ghost magnetic">See the work</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-roster">
            <span class="lbl">Recent engagements</span>
            <div class="names">
              <span>Cordelia ARC</span><span>Kemp Beauty</span><span>Sell Ready AI</span>
              <span>Orange Ashes</span><span>LiveHowYouWant</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="figure">
          <div class="figure-head">
            <span>Fig. 01 – automation canvas</span>
            <button class="canvas-run" id="canvasRun">▶ Run</button>
          </div>
          <div class="flow" id="flow">
            <button class="flow-node" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nd-0">
              <span class="tag tag-trigger">Trigger</span>
              <span class="txt"><strong>New lead submits form</strong><small>GoHighLevel intake funnel</small></span>
              <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
            </button>
            <div class="node-detail" id="nd-0"><div class="node-detail-inner"><dl>
              <dt>Trigger</dt><dd>Form submitted</dd>
              <dt>Source</dt><dd>GHL intake funnel</dd>
              <dt>Filter</dt><dd>none</dd>
            </dl></div></div>
            <div class="flow-connector"></div>

            <button class="flow-node" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nd-1">
              <span class="tag tag-action">Action</span>
              <span class="txt"><strong>Auto-tag &amp; route in CRM</strong><small>Builds the follow-up sequence</small></span>
              <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
            </button>
            <div class="node-detail" id="nd-1"><div class="node-detail-inner"><dl>
              <dt>Action</dt><dd>Add tag → assign pipeline</dd>
              <dt>Branch</dt><dd>by source + time slot</dd>
              <dt>Then</dt><dd>enrol in nurture sequence</dd>
            </dl></div></div>
            <div class="flow-connector"></div>

            <button class="flow-node" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nd-2">
              <span class="tag tag-action">Sync</span>
              <span class="txt"><strong>Push to Sheets, notify ops</strong><small>Zapier keeps systems in step</small></span>
              <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
            </button>
            <div class="node-detail" id="nd-2"><div class="node-detail-inner"><dl>
              <dt>Zap</dt><dd>GHL → Google Sheets</dd>
              <dt>Also</dt><dd>Slack alert to ops channel</dd>
              <dt>Retry</dt><dd>on failure, 3×</dd>
            </dl></div></div>
            <div class="flow-connector"></div>

            <button class="flow-node" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nd-3">
              <span class="tag tag-trigger">Result</span>
              <span class="txt"><strong>900 → 36,000+ members</strong><small>in 8 months, hands-off</small></span>
              <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
            </button>
            <div class="node-detail" id="nd-3"><div class="node-detail-inner"><dl>
              <dt>Window</dt><dd>8 months</dd>
              <dt>Growth</dt><dd>900 → 36,000+ members</dd>
              <dt>Headcount</dt><dd>unchanged</dd>
            </dl></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="figure-cap">Click a node to inspect its configuration. Press Run to trace the path end to end.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="dashboard">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="bento">

        <a href="/work" class="bento-card span-2 reveal">
          <div class="bento-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="13" rx="1"/><path d="M8 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Client work</h3>
          <p>Four builds, live in production: Cordelia ARC, Kemp Beauty, Sell Ready AI, Orange Ashes. Each opens into the full record — what was broken, how I diagnosed it, and what shipped.</p>
          <div class="bento-tags">
            <span class="bento-pill">React + Supabase</span>
            <span class="bento-pill">Klaviyo</span>
            <span class="bento-pill">Shopify Liquid</span>
            <span class="bento-pill">GoHighLevel</span>
          </div>
          <span class="bento-more">View all work →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/about" class="bento-card reveal">
          <div class="bento-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4.4 3.6-7 8-7s8 2.6 8 7"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>About</h3>
          <p>Background, work history, and a Computer Science degree that means I go as deep as the problem requires.</p>
          <span class="bento-more">Read more →</span>
        </a>

        <div class="bento-card reveal">
          <div class="bento-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M13 2 3 14h7l-1 8 11-14h-7l1-6z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Track record</h3>
          <p class="num mono" data-count="36000" data-suffix="+" style="font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin:4px 0;">36,000+</p>
          <p>community members scaled from 900, in 8 months — hands-off, on autopilot.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-card reveal">
          <div class="bento-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4v16h16"/><path d="m7 14 4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Deliverability &amp; scale</h3>
          <p class="num mono" data-count="3000" data-suffix="+" style="font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin:4px 0;">3,000+</p>
          <p>customers supported through CRM ops in 5 months.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-card span-3 reveal">
          <div class="bento-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Where I plug into your business</h3>
          <p>Each engagement starts the same way an automation does — with a clear trigger and a defined outcome.</p>
          <div class="bento-tags" style="margin-top:18px;">
            <span class="bento-pill">GoHighLevel CRM &amp; Workflow Build</span>
            <span class="bento-pill">Marketing Automation</span>
            <span class="bento-pill">Operations Management</span>
            <span class="bento-pill">Integrations &amp; Zapier</span>
            <span class="bento-pill">Email Deliverability &amp; Klaviyo</span>
            <span class="bento-pill">Storefronts &amp; Web Builds</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="#contact" class="bento-card span-3 reveal" style="flex-direction:row; align-items:center; gap:20px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <div class="bento-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="margin:0;">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m2 7 10 6 10-6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div style="flex:1; min-width:200px;">
            <h3>Let's automate your operations.</h3>
            <p>GoHighLevel build, CRM cleanup, deliverability rescue, or full ops management — tell me what's slowing your business down.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="bento-more" style="padding-top:0;">Get in touch →</span>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
